<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 15:23:32 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>金星拥有卫星的时间可能已近20亿年</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/venus-may-have-had-a-moon-for-nearly-2-billion-years</link><description>一颗卫星可能曾经被金星吞噬，与金星共存长达 17 亿年&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/venus-may-have-had-a-moon-for-nearly-2-billion-years.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 15:23:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/venus-may-have-had-a-moon-for-nearly-2-billion-years</guid></item><item><title>CADASIL 患者大血管疾病的患病率和临床影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/prevalence-and-clinical-impact-of-large-vessel-disease-in-patients-with-cadasil</link><description>双物种原子阵列减少了技术开销（不需要本地寻址和无损中电路测量），并为量子网络和分布式计算中的应用提供高效的纠缠净化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/prevalence-and-clinical-impact-of-large-vessel-disease-in-patients-with-cadasil2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 15:08:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/prevalence-and-clinical-impact-of-large-vessel-disease-in-patients-with-cadasil</guid></item><item><title>人工智能如何规划前往半人马座阿尔法星的星际之旅</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-ai-plotted-an-interstellar-journey-to-alpha-centauri</link><description>一个非营利组织叫做&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-ai-plotted-an-interstellar-journey-to-alpha-centauri.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:53:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-ai-plotted-an-interstellar-journey-to-alpha-centauri</guid></item><item><title>不确定性的创造力：波兰诗人辛波斯卡华丽的诺贝尔奖获奖感言</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-creative-power-of-uncertainty-polish-poet-wislawa-szymborskas-magnificent-nobel-prize-acceptance-speech</link><description>无论灵感是什么，它都源于不断的“我不知道”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-creative-power-of-uncertainty-polish-poet-wislawa-szymborskas-magnificent-nobel-prize-acceptance-speech.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:38:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-creative-power-of-uncertainty-polish-poet-wislawa-szymborskas-magnificent-nobel-prize-acceptance-speech</guid></item><item><title>哈佛大学神经科学家将胡椒大小的人类脑细胞团块在培养皿中保存了五年多</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/harvard-neuroscientists-kept-peppercornsized-clumps-of-human-brain-cells-alive-in-a-dish-for-more-than-five-years</link><description>哈佛领导的一个团队已经让胡椒大小的人类大脑类器官存活并成熟了五年多，是之前 694 天记录的三倍多，该组织密切跟踪人类发育时间，以至于较老的细胞可以在提示时提前几个月。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/harvard-neuroscientists-kept-peppercornsized-clumps-of-human-brain-cells-alive-in-a-dish-for-more-than-five-years.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:23:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/harvard-neuroscientists-kept-peppercornsized-clumps-of-human-brain-cells-alive-in-a-dish-for-more-than-five-years</guid></item><item><title>德克萨斯州数据中心地图：查看 600 多个数据中心正在运营或规划的位置</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/texas-data-center-map-see-where-600-data-centers-are-operating-or-planned</link><description>德克萨斯州拥有 600 多个数据中心。探索我们全州运营和规划项目的交互式地图。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/texas-data-center-map-see-where-600-data-centers-are-operating-or-planned.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:08:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/texas-data-center-map-see-where-600-data-centers-are-operating-or-planned</guid></item><item><title>2010年，美国科学家将染料注入蒙大拿州的密苏里河，并追踪了41.2英里；一个水库将羽流容纳了 8.2 小时，有助于预测化学品泄漏时间</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-2010-us-scientists-released-dye-into-montanas-missouri-river-and-tracked-it-across-41-2-miles-one-reservoir-held-the-plume-for-8-2-hours-helping-predict-chemicalspill-timing</link><description>河流可以携带污染物远远超出其进入水的地方，但准确预测该物质的移动速度并不总是那么简单。 2010年，美国科学家&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/in-2010-us-scientists-released-dye-into-montanas-missouri-river-and-tracked-it-across-41-2-miles-one-reservoir-held-the-plume-for-8-2-hours-helping-predict-chemicalspill-timing.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 13:53:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-2010-us-scientists-released-dye-into-montanas-missouri-river-and-tracked-it-across-41-2-miles-one-reservoir-held-the-plume-for-8-2-hours-helping-predict-chemicalspill-timing</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局科学家在太空中种植玉米种子，发现微重力改变了幼苗根和芽的生长方式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-scientists-grew-corn-seeds-in-space-and-found-that-microgravity-changed-how-the-seedlings-roots-and-shoots-grew</link><description>早在宇航员在月球或火星上播种之前，美国宇航局就已经在地球的家门口测试了一个简单得多的问题：当玉米种子在没有重力的情况下发芽时会发生什么？早在 20 世纪 90 年代初，研究人员就将干玉米粒带上航天飞机，让它们在轨道上发芽，并将它们与地面正常重力下生长的相同幼苗进行比较。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-scientists-grew-corn-seeds-in-space-and-found-that-microgravity-changed-how-the-seedlings-roots-and-shoots-grew.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 13:38:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-scientists-grew-corn-seeds-in-space-and-found-that-microgravity-changed-how-the-seedlings-roots-and-shoots-grew</guid></item><item><title>安永会计师事务所将为表现出人际交往能力的员工颁发 1 亿美元奖金</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ernst-young-to-award-100-million-in-bonuses-for-employees-who-show-people-skills</link><description>安永已经看到了未来，它让人们做人工智能做不到的事情。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ernst-young-to-award-100-million-in-bonuses-for-employees-who-show-people-skills.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 13:23:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ernst-young-to-award-100-million-in-bonuses-for-employees-who-show-people-skills</guid></item><item><title>亚瑟·C·克拉克的三定律：当未来看起来像魔法时</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/arthur-c-clarkes-3-laws-when-the-future-looks-like-magic</link><description>六十年前，一个男人坐在镜头前描述了我们今天生活的世界。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/arthur-c-clarkes-3-laws-when-the-future-looks-like-magic.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 13:08:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/arthur-c-clarkes-3-laws-when-the-future-looks-like-magic</guid></item></channel></rss>